==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|ōminōsus||full of foreboding}}, from {{m|la|ōmen||forbidden fruit, omen}}, from {{der|en|itc-ola|osmen}}, of uncertain origin, with many origins proposed (see {{l|la|ōmen}}).

