* {{IPA|en|/ˈɒmɪnəs/|a=RP}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-ominous.wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɑmɪnəs/|a=GA,CA}}
